/416700/extras/a9a3ee0678fd2c0b80bc4744e146b2c6.webp?t=1582910727\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Original minigames included: Rage Invaders, Super Rage Box, Lethal Rage<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/416700/extras/a9a3ee0678fd2c0b80bc4744e146b2c6.webp?t=1582910727\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Customize your junkbot playing online (NEW assets to dress it up!)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/416700/extras/a9a3ee0678fd2c0b80bc4744e146b2c6.webp?t=1582910727\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Retro atmosphere, but cool Unreal Engine graphics, so that your hardware won’t be wasted",
